    {
      "id": "JaoKZGaeOaTXrhkB3TR_T",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 49.14703592946785,
      "y": 20.28635313642411,
      "width": 751.0994873046875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2096385198,
      "version": 613,
      "versionNonce": 1994581426,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782240259230,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-functional\n1. Availability >> consistency: webhook might arrive and process out of order,\nuser should always able to submit webhook request (p99.99)\n2. Latency: register webhook should be p95 > 200ms\n3. High scalability: support 1B DAU, average 10k events/sec, peak 50k/sec\n4. Fault tolerant with retries: system should auto retry delivery\n5. Security: event will be signed by HMAC so client can verify authenticity ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-functional\n1. Availability >> consistency: webhook might arrive and process out of order,\nuser should always able to submit webhook request (p99.99)\n2. Latency: register webhook should be p95 > 200ms\n3. High scalability: support 1B DAU, average 10k events/sec, peak 50k/sec\n4. Fault tolerant with retries: system should auto retry delivery\n5. Security: event will be signed by HMAC so client can verify authenticity ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
