    {
      "id": "krIL1j79PlAfZ67Cqtm0j",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1702.8766721681122,
      "y": 843.6183031552291,
      "width": 592.6195068359375,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1210000046,
      "version": 716,
      "versionNonce": 926729763,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785898215077,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n\n\n\n1/ During sending event: the source sign the signature\nprovided by the webhook system using the source-secret\nand add to the header of the request. Then the webhook\nmanager will verify the signature by signing the same payload\nusing same secret. then compare the signature\n2/ During delivery event: the event processor will sign \nthe payload using sigining secret. client side perform \nsame HMAC signature compute using same signing secret\n==> source-secret and signing-secret all blongs to \nsame webhook system, so man in the middle attack will\nbe prevented. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n\n\n\n1/ During sending event: the source sign the signature\nprovided by the webhook system using the source-secret\nand add to the header of the request. Then the webhook\nmanager will verify the signature by signing the same payload\nusing same secret. then compare the signature\n2/ During delivery event: the event processor will sign \nthe payload using sigining secret. client side perform \nsame HMAC signature compute using same signing secret\n==> source-secret and signing-secret all blongs to \nsame webhook system, so man in the middle attack will\nbe prevented. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "j9X3Y2DRLM_qQqJLFLSmI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2423.7468757517304,
      "y": 840.4891117407791,
      "width": 462.69970703125,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 888441774,
      "version": 400,
      "versionNonce": 104690627,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785898241702,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "HTTP response action\n200 success\n429 rate limit exceeds - retry with longer delay\n4xx: client error - no retry\n5xx: internal server error, retry with delay\nTIMEOUT: retry with delay\n\nTo ensure no data loas\n1. DB replicas\n2. queue durability (DLQ)\n3. Regular backup EB\n4. Event sourcing : event should be immutable,\nnever delete",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "HTTP response action\n200 success\n429 rate limit exceeds - retry with longer delay\n4xx: client error - no retry\n5xx: internal server error, retry with delay\nTIMEOUT: retry with delay\n\nTo ensure no data loas\n1. DB replicas\n2. queue durability (DLQ)\n3. Regular backup EB\n4. Event sourcing : event should be immutable,\nnever delete",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
