      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A. The \"Fan-Out\" Problem (Scale)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cjMMsAd5T2zOEbuQy4jrg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 144.97415271262395,
      "y": 3130.0904086039745,
      "width": 658.3237387574808,
      "height": 44.05392470365671,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1818474738,
      "version": 219,
      "versionNonce": 24744690,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782242284047,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Challenge: A single event might need to go to 10,000 subscribers. Querying a\nstandard SQL DB for every event is too slow.",
      "fontSize": 17.621569881462683,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Challenge: A single event might need to go to 10,000 subscribers. Querying a standard SQL DB for every event is too slow.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "al4XQuKyulEpZtXj2p8QZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 314.07060123992807,
      "y": 3193.9685994242764,
      "width": 320.13084170287254,
      "height": 22.026962351828356,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1199965998,
      "version": 219,
      "versionNonce": 450022702,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782242284047,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solution: An Inverted Index in Redis.",
      "fontSize": 17.621569881462683,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Solution: An Inverted Index in Redis.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PUwCAb8daPDOyTKEoPu08",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 231.87482133167114,
      "y": 3224.8063467168363,
      "width": 484.5224015193864,
      "height": 22.026962351828356,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1629735602,
      "version": 219,
      "versionNonce": 1248748722,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782242284047,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Structure: Key = event_type, Value = Set<webhook_ids>.",
      "fontSize": 17.621569881462683,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Structure: Key = event_type, Value = Set<webhook_ids>.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QMckLTK20uiLa8Hm-ISuX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 128.6829661847303,
      "y": 3244.630612833482,
      "width": 690.9061118132681,
      "height": 44.05392470365671,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 198766958,
      "version": 219,
      "versionNonce": 631043950,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782242284047,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Optimization: For \"hot\" event types (e.g., \"user_update\"), shard the key into\nevent_type:0 ... event_type:N to spread the read load across the Redis cluster.",
      "fontSize": 17.621569881462687,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Optimization: For \"hot\" event types (e.g., \"user_update\"), shard the key into event_type:0 ... event_type:N to spread the read load across the Redis cluster.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gfs_cAuw1eRF8h4Pa1u9B",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 353.27858078199165,
      "y": 3308.508803653784,
      "width": 241.71488261874538,
      "height": 22.026962351828356,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1870374002,
      "version": 219,
      "versionNonce": 1214447218,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782242284047,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "B. Idempotency & Durability",
